<title>USA: LIDAK Pharmaceuticals names CFO.</title>
<headline>LIDAK Pharmaceuticals names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>LA JOLLA, Calif. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIDAK Pharmaceuticals Tuesday said it named Susan Yeagley Sullivan as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Yeagley Sullivan was formerly a senior vice president finance and treasurer at PMR Corp.</p>
<p>LIDAK Pharmaceuticals is developing therapeutic products against virally caused diseases, inflammatory disorders and cancer.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available for details on the previous CFO.</p>
